WEBVTT

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:10.680
Hello.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.320
Welcome to the English Universe family.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.120
My name is Ted.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.160
Hi, My name is Gaby.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:20.160
In this unit, you learned so many things.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:21.440
That's right.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.040
You learned classroom instructions like

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:26.000
sit down

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:27.920
stand up

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.320
You also learn the magic words.

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.840
What are the magic words, Gaby?

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:35.520
The magic words are please and thank you.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.120
You always say please and thank you.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.200
We are also working on learning the alphabet

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:45.200
Can you remember a word with the letter "a"?

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:51.040
Can you remember a word with the letter "b"?

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:55.280
And do you remember what this is?

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:58.600
Yes.

00:00:59.120 --> 00:00:59.960
A cat.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:01.560
C as in cat.

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:02.800
Now you say it.

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:06.840
Good job.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Let's practice.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:09.360
A as in

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:14.440
A as in apple.

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:15.240
Good job.

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:16.520
B as in

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:21.400
B as in banana.

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:22.400
Well done.

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:25.080
Another very important thing you learned is

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:26.800
to say and spell your name

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:28.960
and ask your friends about their name.

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:30.640
For example,

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:32.400
What's your name?

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:38.400
My name is Ted. T-e-d.

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:39.960
Ted, What is your name?

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:43.560
My name is Gaby.

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:47.440
G-a-b-y.

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:48.480
Gaby,

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:51.160
Now go to the assessment section and cross

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:53.040
the emoji that is right for you.

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:54.800
It's time to say goodbye.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:55.480
For now,

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:57.160
My name is Ted

00:01:57.520 --> 00:01:58.800
My name is Gaby

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:01.160
and we will see you in the next fun clip.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:02.120
Bye.
